{"id":"c54d379516c87001","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion.md","title":"Theorem — 自然数层满足递归泛性质","display":"Theorem — 自然数层满足递归泛性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion","aliases":["14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion"],"display":"Theorem — 自然数层满足递归泛性质","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]]","[[14-df-topological-open-site]]","[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","[[14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction]]","[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 269–270; VI.8, printed 319; DjVu 140–141,165","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 自然数层满足递归泛性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4d8ebf261be7db8\" href=\"?note=f4d8ebf261be7db8\" title=\"14-df-natural-number-sheaf\">14-df-natural-number-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4e3ae7c7e6e5902\" href=\"?note=f4e3ae7c7e6e5902\" title=\"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction\">14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e8e6cd022ad4f84\" href=\"?note=2e8e6cd022ad4f84\" title=\"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno\">14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 269–270; VI.8, printed 319; DjVu 140–141,165"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a8105e59309bc16\" href=\"?note=3a8105e59309bc16\" title=\"14-df-topological-open-site\">14-df-topological-open-site</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯。采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4d8ebf261be7db8\" href=\"?note=f4d8ebf261be7db8\" title=\"14-df-natural-number-sheaf\">14-df-natural-number-sheaf</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)\">\\(a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)\\)</span> 是有源靶自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为外部自然数；每个开集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 上的集合箭头迭代满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}\">\\(h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}\">\\(h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in N_X(U)\">\\(n\\in N_X(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in F(U)\">\\(t\\in F(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]\">\\(n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]\\)</span> 是开集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U\">\\(\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_U\">\\(u_U\\)</span> 与自然变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad t|_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}=h_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}^{\\circ k}\\bigl(a_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}(*)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad t|_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}=h_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}^{\\circ k}\\bigl(a_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}(*)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\forall n\\in N_X(U)\\quad\\exists!t\\in F(U)\\ \\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\forall n\\in N_X(U)\\quad\\exists!t\\in F(U)\\ \\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nu_U\\coloneqq\\left(N_X(U),F(U),\\{(n,t)\\in N_X(U)\\times F(U)\\mid\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\}\\right),\\\\\nu\\coloneqq(N_X,F,(u_U)_{U\\in\\tau}),\\qquad u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F),\\\\\nu\\circ z_X=a,\\qquad u\\circ s_X=h\\circ u,\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F)\\quad v\\circ z_X=a\\land v\\circ s_X=h\\circ v,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(N_X,z_X,s_X).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nu_U\\coloneqq\\left(N_X(U),F(U),\\{(n,t)\\in N_X(U)\\times F(U)\\mid\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\}\\right),\\\\\nu\\coloneqq(N_X,F,(u_U)_{U\\in\\tau}),\\qquad u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F),\\\\\nu\\circ z_X=a,\\qquad u\\circ s_X=h\\circ u,\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F)\\quad v\\circ z_X=a\\land v\\circ s_X=h\\circ v,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(N_X,z_X,s_X).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的开纤维两两不交并覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；所列截面在交上相容，空交上截面唯一，因此层条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecMatch}\">\\(\\operatorname{RecMatch}\\)</span> 的存在唯一性。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_U\">\\(u_U\\)</span> 的第三分量是全函数的图，完整三元组是集合箭头。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,h\">\\(a,h\\)</span> 的自然性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 与限制交换。按各开纤维验证零与后继方程。对另一候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>，先对普通自然数作外部有限归纳，确定它在每个常值截面上的值，再利用开纤维覆盖和层唯一性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=u\">\\(v=u\\)</span>。所写范畴复合与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f4d8ebf261be7db8\" href=\"?note=f4d8ebf261be7db8\" title=\"14-df-natural-number-sheaf\">14-df-natural-number-sheaf</a>的同一有类型结构相容，恰为自然数对象泛性质。</p>\n<p>也可用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f4e3ae7c7e6e5902\" href=\"?note=f4e3ae7c7e6e5902\" title=\"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction\">14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction</a> 的常层—全局截面伴随以及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2e8e6cd022ad4f84\" href=\"?note=2e8e6cd022ad4f84\" title=\"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno\">14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno</a> 得到相同结论。原笔记定位：VI.1，pp.269–270；VI.8，p.319。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-number-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f4d8ebf261be7db8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-open-site","status":"resolved","id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"f4e3ae7c7e6e5902","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno","status":"resolved","id":"2e8e6cd022ad4f84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-open-site","status":"resolved","id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"由 [[14-df-topological-open-site]]，$\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 为初等拓扑斯。采用 [[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]] 的 $\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X$。$F$ 为 $X$ 上的层，$a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)$、$h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)$ 是有源靶自然变换。$k\\in\\mathbb N$ 为外部自然数；每个开集 $V$ 上的集合箭头迭代满足 $h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}$、$h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}$。$U\\in\\tau$，$n\\in N_X(U)$，$t\\in F(U)$，$n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]$ 是开集。$\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U$、$u_U$ 与自然变换 $u$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-number-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f4d8ebf261be7db8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"由 [[14-df-topological-open-site]]，$\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 为初等拓扑斯。采用 [[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]] 的 $\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X$。$F$ 为 $X$ 上的层，$a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)$、$h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)$ 是有源靶自然变换。$k\\in\\mathbb N$ 为外部自然数；每个开集 $V$ 上的集合箭头迭代满足 $h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}$、$h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}$。$U\\in\\tau$，$n\\in N_X(U)$，$t\\in F(U)$，$n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]$ 是开集。$\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U$、$u_U$ 与自然变换 $u$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-number-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f4d8ebf261be7db8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$a,h$ 的自然性保证 $u$ 与限制交换。按各开纤维验证零与后继方程。对另一候选 $v$，先对普通自然数作外部有限归纳，确定它在每个常值截面上的值，再利用开纤维覆盖和层唯一性得 $v=u$。所写范畴复合与[[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]]的同一有类型结构相容，恰为自然数对象泛性质。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"f4e3ae7c7e6e5902","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"也可用 [[14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction]] 的常层—全局截面伴随以及 [[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]] 得到相同结论。原笔记定位：VI.1，pp.269–270；VI.8，p.319。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno","status":"resolved","id":"2e8e6cd022ad4f84","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"也可用 [[14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction]] 的常层—全局截面伴随以及 [[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]] 得到相同结论。原笔记定位：VI.1，pp.269–270；VI.8，p.319。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}","display":false},{"tex":"h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in N_X(U)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in F(U)","display":false},{"tex":"n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U","display":false},{"tex":"u_U","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad t|_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}=h_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}^{\\circ k}\\bigl(a_{n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]}(*)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U\\in\\tau\\ \\forall n\\in N_X(U)\\quad\\exists!t\\in F(U)\\ \\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nu_U\\coloneqq\\left(N_X(U),F(U),\\{(n,t)\\in N_X(U)\\times F(U)\\mid\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U(n,t)\\}\\right),\\\\\nu\\coloneqq(N_X,F,(u_U)_{U\\in\\tau}),\\qquad u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F),\\\\\nu\\circ z_X=a,\\qquad u\\circ s_X=h\\circ u,\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(N_X,F)\\quad v\\circ z_X=a\\land v\\circ s_X=h\\circ v,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(N_X,z_X,s_X).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecMatch}","display":false},{"tex":"u_U","display":false},{"tex":"a,h","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"v=u","display":false}],"bytes":2844,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion|thm-260 — 自然数层满足递归泛性质]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion|thm-260 — 自然数层满足递归泛性质]]"},{"id":"1cbcddc9f0a3bcfb","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(X,\\tau)$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小拓扑空间，$\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的完整范畴，并采用 [[14-df-topological-open-site]] 的开集站点对应及拓扑斯结构。$\\mathbb Q\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ 取通常的有序数域及其包含，$\\mathbb R$ 取通常拓扑，$*$ 为固定单点标签。$Q_X=\\Delta_X\\mathbb Q$ 是 [[14-df-constant-sheaves]] 的有理数常层，故 $Q_X(V)$ 的元素是 $V\\to\\mathbb Q$ 的局部常值函数。其序子层 $O_Q$ 及包含 $o_Q:O_Q\\hookrightarrow Q_X\\times Q_X$ 由下式明确给出。$\\mathcal C_X=C_{\\mathbb R}$ 是 [[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]] 的连续实值函数层。固定逐点积、分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$ 与指数；$P_Q=\\Omega^{Q_X}$。$N_X,z_X,s_X$ 采用 [[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]]，并由 [[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion]] 满足自然数对象泛性质；$D_X=(N_X\\times N_X)\\times N_X$。有理商箭头 $q_X:D_X\\to Q_X$ 在 Assertion 给出。将 [[14-df-internal-dedekind-reals]] 的结构参数明确实例化为 $(N,z,s)=(N_X,z_X,s_X)$、$Q=Q_X$、$\\varpi=q_X$、$o=o_Q$，并固定其截子对象代表 $\\iota_{\\mathbb R}:\\mathcal R\\hookrightarrow P_Q\\times P_Q$；$\\mathcal R=\\mathbb R_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}$。"}],"outgoing":["f4d8ebf261be7db8","3a8105e59309bc16","8ee22b56cc1189dc","f4e3ae7c7e6e5902","2e8e6cd022ad4f84"]}